### Admin Users Management Test Suite

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5258/api/v1
@adminToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIyIiwibmFtZSI6IkFkbWluIFVzZXIiLCJyb2xlIjoiQWRtaW4iLCJpYXQiOjE3MzA5MzcyMDB9.dummytoken
@userId = 1

### 1. Update User Status (Activate/Deactivate)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

###

### 2. Update User Role
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "Customer"
}

###

### 3. Set User Rank Title (Top Contributor)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/set-title
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rankTitle": "Top Contributor"
}

###

### 4. Clear User Rank Title
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/set-title
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rankTitle": null
}

###

### 5. Set Custom Rank Title
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/set-title
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rankTitle": "Rising Star"
}

###

### 6. Set Rank Title for Non-existent User (should return 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/99999/set-title
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rankTitle": "Admin"
}

###
